# Wave W17-N (Route 111): dune turf — failing grass at the desert’s edge: dry olive-green going thin, with the dune sand already creeping through it in pale flecks toward the dune line (design: calm speckled grass failing into open desert sand; picnickers eating exactly where the grass gives up). Route 111’s own ground — the grass still holds the west of the route; the shipped desertsand biome east of it stands byte-preserved by spec, and this turf is drawn to fail INTO it.
